[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Ll]og/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/publish/

# Output & Log files
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.runtimeconfig.dev.json
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

